// RFC6298 2.1 initial RTO value
// Ensure that TCP PAWS checks are relaxed after ~2147 seconds
// to avoid overflows. This assumes a clock smaller than 1 Mhz.
// Default clock is 1 Khz, tcp_usec_ts uses 1 Mhz.
